cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Greenhouse gas emissions, energy use and economic growth in
  Canadian provinces
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite both the
  underlying thesis and this repository.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Heidari
    given-names: Sima
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible reimplementation in R of the econometric analysis in
  Sima Heidari's 2023 Master's project at the University of
  Saskatchewan, testing cointegration and Granger causality between
  greenhouse gas emissions, industrial energy use and real GDP across
  ten Canadian provinces and nationally, 1997-2019.
keywords:
  - econometrics
  - cointegration
  - Granger causality
  - greenhouse gas emissions
  - energy economics
  - Canada
  - reproducibility
references:
  - type: thesis
    title: Aggregation and Causality in Environmental Accounts
    authors:
      - family-names: Heidari
        given-names: Sima
    year: 2023
    institution:
      name: University of Saskatchewan
    department: Department of Economics
    thesis-type: Master's project
